    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ark Odyssey</strong> is a top-down arcade shooter that lets you command an army of starships to fight against the force of void!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to recruit a wide variety of starship squadrons, each one having a unique design and origin, custom passive, attack pattern, and special abilities! Build your very own fleet of unique squadrons by freely customizing unit composition into each different formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a tactician on the battlefield, shift between different formations in combat for greater advantage, and focus fire with your squadron at crucial moments to turn the tides of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/a2a08c6478b5418cb72440b3937a9621.poster.avif?t=1744338556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/a2a08c6478b5418cb72440b3937a9621.webm?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/a2a08c6478b5418cb72440b3937a9621.mp4?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/a6dc4a047147a5730f92d38451ad6956.poster.avif?t=1744338556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/a6dc4a047147a5730f92d38451ad6956.webm?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/a6dc4a047147a5730f92d38451ad6956.mp4?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/ccfa04da18320ac9905f5e1ccdcca6e3.poster.avif?t=1744338556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/ccfa04da18320ac9905f5e1ccdcca6e3.webm?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/ccfa04da18320ac9905f5e1ccdcca6e3.mp4?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Feature</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a unique build of fun and dazzling fleet of starships.</strong> With more than 50+ unique squadrons of starships and 100+ artifacts, you will be able to assemble your very own different army each run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/67ded4c395ca4402693dd2e91fbfaec4.poster.avif?t=1744338556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/67ded4c395ca4402693dd2e91fbfaec4.webm?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/67ded4c395ca4402693dd2e91fbfaec4.mp4?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly customizable team building.</strong> Freely adjust unit composition for each different formation, plan attack order and ability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/673fbada4d229d374fa7d77dceb460a9.poster.avif?t=1744338556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/673fbada4d229d374fa7d77dceb460a9.webm?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701870/extras/673fbada4d229d374fa7d77dceb460a9.mp4?t=1744338556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive gameplay.</strong> Build your fleet however you like, focus on your ace frigate, or squadrons of agile fighters, or assemble an army of death lasers!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel like tactician on the battlefield.</strong> Dynamically shift between 3 different formations, command your fleet to focus fire and chain abilities in sequence.</p></li></ul>",
